{"page":20033,"part":1,"text":"笔意赞\n\n\n书之妙道，神彩为上，形质次之，兼之者方可绍于古人。以斯言之，岂易多得？必使心忘于笔，手忘于书，心手达情，书不妄想，是谓求之不得，考之即彰。乃为《笔意赞》曰：\n\n剡纸易墨，心圆管直。浆深色浓，万毫齐力。先临《告誓》，次写《黄庭》。骨丰肉润，入妙通灵。努如直槊，勒若横钉。开张凤翼，耸擢芝英。粗不为重，细不为轻。纤微向背，毫发死生。工之尽矣，可擅时名。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20033,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"6cb04fd3caefa77c38a61eceabcb53cf2d217f00a4035262a8d829b24e7fd401","textSha256":"6cb04fd3caefa77c38a61eceabcb53cf2d217f00a4035262a8d829b24e7fd401","fileSha256":"6cb04fd3caefa77c38a61eceabcb53cf2d217f00a4035262a8d829b24e7fd401","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20033-work-032.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"笔意赞 · 笔意赞","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/uzTAH6r9HtAnCEyXLJWyMg","originalPages":[74],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":4,"sourceTextSha256":"f35f80b16f38d02eef77ed6f5a6f0fcdf37c52f058cac6bd27eb90a02b2224f8","id":"local-74-16-26","page_id":74,"origin":"legacy-reviewed-txt","rawStart":16,"rawEnd":26,"reviewedTextSha256":"076d0cbff259afa0d15112a5ce4f46300e2b387c392a717e2b4f514ca5fd312e","displayUnitOrigins":[[22,23],[23,24],[24,25],[25,26]],"legacySource":{"kind":"human-txt","page":74,"part":1,"label":"人工审核原TXT","verifiedBy":"肖源","verifiedAt":"2026-10-20T02:07:42.390Z","revision":"076d0cbff259afa0d15112a5ce4f46300e2b387c392a717e2b4f514ca5fd312e","textSha256":"076d0cbff259afa0d15112a5ce4f46300e2b387c392a717e2b4f514ca5fd312e","fileSha256":"79106ac65424604a53ca79186ecc2bad7dbbdc92135f4d626b3d9b63cebb6e55","txtPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-逐页校勘.txt","reviewCsvPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-TXT校验表.csv","reviewJsonPath":"tasks/2026-10-21-review-package-update/extracted/member-1-part-1/第1份-初筛进度备份.json"}},{"start":6,"end":84,"sourceTextSha256":"35d1c